<title>NETHERLANDS: Stroeve raises Endemol to outperformer.</title>
<headline>Stroeve raises Endemol to outperformer.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Research note summary (17/4)</p>
<p>Company-------Sector----------Price---Broker--------------</p>
<p>ENDEMOL	 TV production   50.00   Effectenbank Stroeve</p>
<p>COMMENT: Raised to OUTPERFORMER from Match. Shares have fallen sharply from high of 63.50 in March due to concern about Holiday on Ice unit and reports of less rosy prospects in German TV market. However, fears of slower growth in Germany are not well founded. New contract with RTL may be worth less than old three-year NLG 200 million contract but sales to other German channels should rise.</p>
<p>Company has signed deal to produce Bild TV for SAT1 five days a week and still targets 15 pct annual growth in Germany. Long-term outlook remains good, though negative sentiment towards shares might persist for some time.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):  EPS		   P/E    P/CF   Dividend</p>
<p>    1996/97	     2.25 (unch.)	22.2   ----   ----</p>
<p>    1997/98	     2.60 (unch.)	19.3   ----   ----</p>
